@host = http://localhost:5233

### 1. Создать заявителя
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Applicants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lastName": "Петров",
  "firstName": "Иван",
  "middleName": "Сергеевич",
  "email": "ivan.petrov@mail.ru",
  "phone": "+79991234567"
}

### 2. Создать офицера
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Officers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lastName": "Сидоров",
  "firstName": "Алексей",
  "middleName": "Петрович",
  "position": "Старший визовый офицер"
}

### Подставь id из ответов выше
@applicantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@officerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 3. Создать заявку
POST {{host}}/api/v1/VisaApplications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicantId": "{{applicantId}}",
  "number": "VISA-2026-001"
}

@applicationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 4. Заполнить анкету
POST {{host}}/api/v1/VisaApplications/fill-form
Content-Type: application/json

{ "applicantId": "{{applicantId}}", "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}" }

### 5. Подать документы
POST {{host}}/api/v1/VisaApplications/submit-documents
Content-Type: application/json

{ "applicantId": "{{applicantId}}", "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}" }

### 6. Офицер принимает заявку
POST {{host}}/api/v1/VisaApplications/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{ "officerId": "{{officerId}}", "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}" }

### 7. Офицер проверяет данные
POST {{host}}/api/v1/VisaApplications/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "officerId": "{{officerId}}", "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}" }

### 8. Офицер выдаёт визу (или /reject)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/VisaApplications/issue
Content-Type: application/json

{ "officerId": "{{officerId}}", "applicationId": "{{applicationId}}" }

### 9. Заявитель получает результат
GET {{host}}/api/v1/VisaApplications/{{applicationId}}/result?applicantId={{applicantId}}

### Проверка здоровья сервиса и БД
GET {{host}}/health
